                        en: "The Compensation Committee's term of office is three years, from 22 August 2024 to 21 August 2027, except for Mr. Kijja Sripatthangkura, whose term of office is three years, from 29 April 2025 to 28 April 2028, and Mr. Yokporn Tantisawetrat, whose term of office is three years, from 28 March 2025 to 27 March 2028.",
