                        en: "The ESG Committee supports the Board of Directors in the oversight of environmental, social, and governance matters, reporting its performance and submitting proposals to the Board of Directors or to the shareholders' meeting for approval, as the case may be. Duties and Responsibilities of the ESG Committee are as follows:",
